  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into thin rounds. Roughly chop silverbeet. Drain and rinse butter beans.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-3f509ca9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice mini flour tortillas into strips.\n• In a small bowl, combine 1/2 the garlic paste, olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-b7813c9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortilla strips evenly on a lined oven tray (don’t worry if they overlap) and brush or spread with garlic oil. Season. Bake until golden, 10-12 minutes. TIP: If your tray is crowded, toss the tortilla strips halfway through baking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-7f4bae17.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over medium high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, and cook, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate.\n• Cook soffritto mix until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add zucchini and cook until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic & herb spice blend and remaining garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-66eacbcf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add butter beans, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, Italian herbs, vegetable stock powder, brown sugar and water.\n• Bring to the boil, then reduce to a simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add zucchini, silverbeet and the plant-based butter and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-c1c42342.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie ribollita between bowls.\n• Spoon over the plant-based basil pesto. Serve with the garlic dippers and haloumi. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637c59f812c0d87fb40aba5e/step-fcca471a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
